text = "August 4, 1995 — Dawn.

The artillery barrage has begun. Operation Storm is underway.

Your task: Hold the forward positions against enemy counterattacks while our forces prepare the main assault. Survive the waves. Hold the line.

Za dom!"

[node name="StartButton" type="Button" parent="MarginContainer/VBoxContainer"]
